// Services rather than Mapping test suites because only a Service carries an explicit Runtime, and
// the chain lives in the runtime: MappingTestRunner builds its runtime purely from the test's
// store-test-data bindings, so a mapping testSuites block cannot name a ModelChainConnection.
//
// One route over the model and fixture: the relation projection, which is also the only form that
// reaches DuckDB here (RelationalConnectionFactory picks DuckDB when the query returns a Relation
// and H2 otherwise). Why the other two routes are not services is explained at the foot of this
// file. Wider coverage lives in meta::relational::tests::semistructured::modelChain, which injects
// the dialect connection directly.
